<title>UK: Refuge postpones United Friendly EGM.</title>
<headline>Refuge postpones United Friendly EGM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Refuge Group Plc said on Tuesday it proposed to adjourn until October 16 the extraordinary general meeting (EGM) originally convened to approve the proposed merger with United Friendly.</p>
<p>Insurance group Refuge said in a statement it was &quot;continuing to explore effective ways&quot; in which a proposed new security might operate.</p>
</text>
